{"id":"paquete","lemma":"paquete","pos":"noun","rank":1464,"glosses":["parcel","package","chump, useless, butterfingers (an incompetent person)"],"ipa":"/paˈkete/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"paquetes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-paquete.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Puedes con esos paquetes tú solo?","en":"Can you manage those packages by yourself?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/560103","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"sole"}]},{"text":"¿Recibiste mi paquete?","en":"Did you receive my package?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/509983","words":[{"g":"to receive, get","l":"recibir"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Te acaba de llegar un paquete.","en":"A package just arrived for you.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to finish","l":"acabar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to arrive, get"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Cosas buenas vienen en paquetes pequeños.","en":"Good things come in small packages.","words":[{"g":"thing","l":"cosa"},{"g":"hello"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"small","l":"pequeño"}]},{"text":"Él tenía un paquete debajo del brazo.","en":"He held a package under his arm.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"underneath"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"arm in arm"]]}]}